  readers announce it without moving focus. When nothing matches, the table body shows "No events match these filters"
  with a "Clear filters" button.

  Dates are picked and compared in the viewer's local time zone. The stored UTC values aren't touched.

  The filter bar starts hidden and the script reveals it, so with JavaScript off nobody sees controls that can't work.
  The empty table without JavaScript is unchanged and goes into the follow-ups in NOTES.md, as agreed.

